<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <%- include('_head', { title: 'Konten' }) %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('_nav', { admin, section }) %>

    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto p-4 md:p-8 space-y-8">
        <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-white">Kontrol Konten</h1>

        <% if (flash && flash.ok) { %><div class="flash-ok"><%= flash.ok %></div><% } %>
        <% if (flash && flash.err) { %><div class="flash-err"><%= flash.err %></div><% } %>

        <section class="card rounded-2xl p-5">
            <h2 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">📢 Pengumuman di Beranda</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-4">Ditampilkan sebagai banner di atas halaman utama.</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/content" class="space-y-3">
                <input type="hidden" name="form" value="announcement">
                <textarea name="text" rows="3" class="input" maxlength="500" placeholder="Isi pengumuman..."><%= cfg.announcement.text %></textarea>
                <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-300">
                    <input type="checkbox" name="active" <%= cfg.announcement.active ? 'checked' : '' %> class="accent-purple-500 w-4 h-4">
                    Tampilkan pengumuman
                </label>
                <button class="btn">Simpan Pengumuman</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <section class="card rounded-2xl p-5">
            <h2 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">⭐ Anime Unggulan ("Pilihan WibuKon")</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-4">Masukkan <b>ID anime</b> dari situs (angka di URL, mis. <code>4475</code> dari <code>/anime/4475-digimon...</code>). Maks 20, dipisah koma/baris baru. 6 pertama tampil di beranda.</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/content" class="space-y-3">
                <input type="hidden" name="form" value="featured">
                <textarea name="ids" rows="3" class="input font-mono" placeholder="4475, 4412, 4520"><%= (cfg.featured || []).join(', ') %></textarea>
                <button class="btn">Simpan Unggulan</button>
            </form>
            <% if (previews.length) { %>
                <div class="mt-4">
                    <div class="lbl">Preview saat ini</div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <% previews.forEach(p => { %>
                            <a href="/anime/<%= p.slug %>" target="_blank" class="w-24 text-center group">
                                <img src="<%= p.img %>" alt="" class="w-24 h-32 object-cover rounded-lg border border-white/10 group-hover:border-yellow-400 transition" loading="lazy">
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 mt-1 line-clamp-2"><%= p.title %></div>
                            </a>
                        <% }) %>
                    </div>
                </div>
            <% } %>
        </section>

        <section class="card rounded-2xl p-5 border-amber-500/20">
            <h2 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">💎 Info Donasi di Halaman /vip</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-4">Teks ini tampil di atas form permintaan VIP. Isi link Trakteer/Saweria/nomor e-wallet kamu di sini.</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/content" class="space-y-3">
                <input type="hidden" name="form" value="vipinfo">
                <textarea name="text" rows="3" class="input" maxlength="500" placeholder="contoh: Donasi via https://trakteer.id/username ..."><%= cfg.vipInfo || '' %></textarea>
                <button class="btn">Simpan Info Donasi</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <section class="card rounded-2xl p-5 border-red-500/20">
            <h2 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">🚫 Blacklist Anime</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-4">Anime dengan ID ini <b>disembunyikan</b> dari beranda, jadwal, dan pencarian; halaman detail & nontonnya jadi 404. Karena data masuk cache beberapa menit, efeknya tidak instan (maks ±5 menit).</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/content" class="space-y-3">
                <input type="hidden" name="form" value="blacklist">
                <textarea name="ids" rows="3" class="input font-mono" placeholder="1234, 5678"><%= (cfg.blacklist || []).join(', ') %></textarea>
                <button class="btn btn-red">Simpan Blacklist</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
